# Tables of rows in the order their keys were first put, found through an open-addressing index
# by a hash of the key: what the host's maps and sets are made of (D-62). A text key is compared
# by its bytes (D-61); removed rows stay until the rows are compacted.
#
# This module is generated from tools/tables.dsl by tools/build.py.

tables is module
tables purpose "Tables of rows kept in the order their keys were first put, found by hashing: what maps and sets are made of"
tables path tables
tables imports standard.machine
tables imports standard.math
tables imports standard.compare
